.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-sbom 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-sbom \- Derive the SPDX and CycloneDX inventories of this tree, or of a built binary, under the names its release assets carry
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten sbom\fR [\fB\-\-names\fR] [\fB\-\-binary\fR] [\fB\-\-target\fR] [\fB\-\-out\-dir\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Derive the SPDX and CycloneDX inventories of this tree, or of a built binary, under the names its release assets carry
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-names\fR
Print the asset names as KEY=VALUE lines and exit, without scanning
.TP
\fB\-\-binary\fR \fI<binary>\fR
Inventory this built binary from its own bytes instead of the tree
.TP
\fB\-\-target\fR \fI<target>\fR
The target triple the binary was built for, which names its asset
.TP
\fB\-\-out\-dir\fR \fI<out_dir>\fR
Write the documents under this directory instead of the declared one
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
